  "project_description": "The Webform Analysis module provides statistical analysis and visualization for Webform submissions. It allows administrators to generate charts and tables to analyze form data and submission patterns.\n\n Features \n \n Chart Types : Visual representations of form data using:\n \n Tables for data display \n Pie Charts for categorical data \n Column Charts for comparative data \n \n \n Component Selection : Choose which form fields to include in analysis \n Date Range Filtering : Filter submissions by date range \n Draft Submission Analysis : Include or exclude draft submissions \n Block Integration : Display analysis charts using the Webform Analysis block \n Automatic Updates : Analysis updates as new submissions are received \n \n \n See the README.md for installation, configuration and usage instructions .",
